    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Confucius",
            "zh": "孔子"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is one of China’s most famous thinkers. He lived between 551 and 479 B.C. Confucius was a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "government official",
            "ref": "v-government-official"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He believed that a good government was important for a happy society. And a good government needed good officials. A good official had to be “Ren”—kind to other people. Later, Confucius decided to become a teacher. He went to many places and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "spread his ideas",
            "ref": "v-spread-ideas"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " all around the country. He had more than 3,000 students. Many of them later became famous in history."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After Confucius died, Mengzi and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Dong Zhongshu",
            "zh": "董仲舒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " added more "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "values",
            "ref": "v-values"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Confucianism",
            "zh": "儒家思想"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". There are five main "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "virtues",
            "ref": "v-virtue"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Confucianism:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l1",
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Ren for being kind"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Yi for believing in "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "justice",
              "ref": "v-justice"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Li for having good habits and "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "respecting",
              "ref": "v-respect"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " other people"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Zhi for having much knowledge"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Xin for being "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "loyal",
              "ref": "v-loyal"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Chinese people have followed Confucianism for more than 2,000 years. It has also spread to other countries like Japan."
          }
        ]
      },
